# SEC-02 (2026-10-27): signing certificates must never be committed.
# The OpenIddict signing cert committed before 2026-10-27 is compromised by
# exposure; it was rotated in the working tree and must stay out of git.
# Production deployments provision their own cert + App:SslPassword via env.
